  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> be a solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. If&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mn>1</mn> </mfenced></mrow> </math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
